In nethack 3.9, I find myself always trying to force down one more giant, or
another dragon, with the sad result of choking and dying.  However, I have
found a way to get that food down, but it seems strange.  Any opinions?

<<spoiler follows>>

With a cursed tinning kit, all tinned food becomes rotten, yet it allows you
to still gain abilities from them.  That makes three giants a peice of cake
to tin, eat, and quickly vomit up.  Net result, a little hungier, but having
all that you can gain.  Only problem I have is remembering to keep a potion of
unholy water and finding a tinning kit.  

Any recommendations on other ways to accomplish this?
